{
  "schemaVersion": "ride-output-v2.2.0",
  "label": {
    "text": "总距离 161.8 公里的长距离骑行",
    "conclusionType": "fact",
    "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:metric.distanceM"]
  },
  "overallAssessment": {
    "text": "本次骑行总距离 161.8 公里，移动时长 6 小时 40 分钟，累计爬升 2924 米，整体为一次高强度、大负荷的长距离骑行。",
    "conclusionType": "fact",
    "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:metric.distanceM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:timing.movingDurationS", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:metric.elevationGainM"]
  },
  "highlights": [
    {
      "text": "全程累计爬升 2924 米，包含多个高难度爬坡段，其中一段平均坡度 11.1%、爬升 460 米的爬坡展现了较强的爬坡能力。",
      "conclusionType": "fact",
      "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:metric.elevationGainM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-84688-88849.averageGrade", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-84688-88849.netElevationGainM"]
    },
    {
      "text": "10 秒峰值平均功率达到 566W，显示出短时爆发力输出。",
      "conclusionType": "fact",
      "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.peakAverage.10s"]
    }
  ],
  "dimensions": [
    {
      "dimensionId": "pacingExecution",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "text": "本次骑行移动时长 6 小时 40 分钟，总用时 7 小时 2 分钟，途中停车 14 次。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:timing.movingDurationS", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:metric.elapsedDurationS", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:stops.count"]
        },
        {
          "text": "平均速度 24.06 km/h，速度变异系数 49.2%，速度波动较大，且末段速度比首段高 2.57 km/h。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:speed.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:speed.coefficientOfVariation", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:speed.lastMinusFirst"]
        },
        {
          "text": "整体配速波动较大，但末段速度高于首段，可能反映出骑行节奏在后期有所加快。",
          "conclusionType": "interpretation",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:speed.coefficientOfVariation", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:speed.lastMinusFirst"]
        },
        {
          "text": "地形分布上，趋势爬坡距离 70.2 公里，趋势下坡距离 73.3 公里，趋势平路距离 16.1 公里；本地统计爬坡 52.2 公里、平路 53.2 公里、下坡 54.3 公里。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:terrain.trendClimbDistanceM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:terrain.trendDescentDistanceM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:terrain.trendFlatDistanceM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:terrain.localClimbDistanceM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:terrain.localFlatDistanceM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:terrain.localDescentDistanceM"]
        },
        {
          "text": "地形分类覆盖率为 100%，爬坡段 24 个、平路段 41 个、下坡段 22 个。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:terrain.classifiedCoverageRatio", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:terrain.climbRunCount", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:terrain.flatRunCount", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:terrain.descentRunCount"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dimensionId": "climbPerformance",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "text": "全程累计爬升 2924 米，累计下降 2808 米。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:metric.elevationGainM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:metric.elevationLossM"]
        },
        {
          "text": "代表性爬坡段中，最难的爬坡（难度评分 509）长 4.2 公里，平均坡度 11.1%，爬升 460 米，用时 25 分钟，平均功率 256W，平均速度 9.9 km/h。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-84688-88849.difficultyScore", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-84688-88849.distanceM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-84688-88849.averageGrade", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-84688-88849.netElevationGainM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-84688-88849.span", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-84688-88849.power.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-84688-88849.speed.mean"]
        },
        {
          "text": "另一段爬坡（难度评分 268）长 8.1 公里，平均坡度 5.7%，爬升 467 米，用时 38 分钟，平均功率 185W，平均速度 13.26 km/h。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-37936-46050.difficultyScore", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-37936-46050.distanceM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-37936-46050.averageGrade", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-37936-46050.netElevationGainM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-37936-46050.span", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-37936-46050.power.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-37936-46050.speed.mean"]
        },
        {
          "text": "第三段爬坡（难度评分 131）长 5.6 公里，平均坡度 4.9%，爬升 270 米，用时 22 分钟，平均功率 206W，平均速度 16.98 km/h。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-110427-115991.difficultyScore", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-110427-115991.distanceM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-110427-115991.averageGrade", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-110427-115991.netElevationGainM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-110427-115991.span", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-110427-115991.power.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-110427-115991.speed.mean"]
        },
        {
          "text": "本次识别出 15 个爬坡段，其中 3 个最难的作为代表性爬坡段。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:climb.representativeClimbCount"]
        },
        {
          "text": "在难度最高的爬坡段（平均坡度 11.1%）上仍能保持 256W 的平均功率，爬坡输出较为充分。",
          "conclusionType": "interpretation",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-84688-88849.power.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-84688-88849.averageGrade"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dimensionId": "powerOutput",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "text": "平均功率 151W，归一化功率 197W，平均功率体重比 2.15 W/kg，归一化功率体重比 2.82 W/kg。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.normalizedW", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.averageWkg", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.normalizedWkg"]
        },
        {
          "text": "功率变异系数 66.1%，末段功率比首段低 31.5W。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.coefficientOfVariation", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.lastMinusFirst"]
        },
        {
          "text": "10 秒峰值平均功率 566W，20 秒峰值平均功率 538W，30 秒峰值平均功率 516W。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.peakAverage.10s", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.peakAverage.20s", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.peakAverage.30s"]
        },
        {
          "text": "功率区间分布：Z1 占 27%，Z2 占 14%，Z3 占 18%，Z4 占 17%，Z5 占 10%，Z6 占 9%，Z7 占 5%，高强度区间（Z5-Z7）合计占 24%。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.zone.z1", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.zone.z2", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.zone.z3", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.zone.z4", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.zone.z5", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.zone.z6", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.zone.z7", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.zone.highIntensityCombined"]
        },
        {
          "text": "功率与速度在同一时间窗口内的覆盖率为 99%，代表性窗口的覆盖率分别为 100%、100% 和 77%。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:relation.fixed.power-speed.aggregate", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:relation.fixed.power-speed.rep.2", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:relation.fixed.power-speed.rep.3", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:relation.fixed.power-speed.rep.159"]
        },
        {
          "text": "功率输出波动较大，但高强度区间占比达到 24%，且短时峰值功率较高，整体输出强度偏高。",
          "conclusionType": "interpretation",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.coefficientOfVariation", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.zone.highIntensityCombined", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.peakAverage.10s"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dimensionId": "intensityAndTrainingLoad",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "text": "本次骑行强度因子 0.99，训练压力指数 640.2，活动消耗 4439 千卡。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.intensityFactor", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.trainingStressScore", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:metric.activityEnergyKcal"]
        },
        {
          "text": "根据已验证的 FTP 200W，本次骑行强度因子接近 1.0，训练压力指数较高，属于高负荷的单次骑行。",
          "conclusionType": "interpretation",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:profile.verifiedFtpW", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.intensityFactor", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.trainingStressScore"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dimensionId": "cadenceStrategy",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "text": "平均踏频 76 rpm，踏频变异系数 15.3%，末段踏频比首段低 2.9 rpm。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:cadence.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:cadence.coefficientOfVariation", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:cadence.lastMinusFirst"]
        },
        {
          "text": "踏频区间分布：零区间 0%，低区间 7%，平稳区间 37%，耐力区间 44%，高区间 11%，极高区间 0%。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:cadence.zone.zero", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:cadence.zone.low", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:cadence.zone.steady", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:cadence.zone.endurance", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:cadence.zone.high", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:cadence.zone.very-high"]
        },
        {
          "text": "踏频数据部分缺失，平均踏频 76 rpm，主要分布在耐力区间（44%）和平稳区间（37%），整体踏频策略偏向耐力型。",
          "conclusionType": "interpretation",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:cadence.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:cadence.zone.endurance", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:cadence.zone.steady"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dimensionId": "crossSensorCoordination",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "text": "功率与速度在同一时间窗口内的覆盖率为 99%，代表性窗口的覆盖率分别为 100%、100% 和 77%。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:relation.fixed.power-speed.aggregate", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:relation.fixed.power-speed.rep.2", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:relation.fixed.power-speed.rep.3", "claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:relation.fixed.power-speed.rep.159"]
        },
        {
          "text": "功率与速度传感器在绝大多数时间窗口内同步记录，数据对齐程度较高。",
          "conclusionType": "interpretation",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:relation.fixed.power-speed.aggregate"]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "suggestions": [
    {
      "text": "本次骑行训练压力指数较高（640.2），建议后续安排适当恢复，避免连续高强度训练。",
      "conclusionType": "suggestion",
      "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.trainingStressScore"],
      "riskNote": "恢复建议基于单次负荷，不构成恢复状态判断。"
    },
    {
      "text": "下次骑行可尝试在爬坡段保持更均匀的功率输出，以减少功率波动。",
      "conclusionType": "suggestion",
      "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-07-22:v2:power.coefficientOfVariation"]
    }
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "terrain.climbRunCount:AGGREGATED_FROM_24_WINDOWS",
    "terrain.flatRunCount:AGGREGATED_FROM_41_WINDOWS",
    "terrain.descentRunCount:AGGREGATED_FROM_22_WINDOWS",
    "heartRate:SERIES_MISSING",
    "climb.representativeClimbCount:AGGREGATED_FROM_15_WINDOWS",
    "relation.fixed.power-speed.aggregate:AGGREGATED_FROM_776_WINDOWS"
  ]
}
